Run go mod tidy to add github.com/dygoframework/dygo/sql to go.mod.

 Success! CRUD for OrderItem:

   GET    /order-items          List    (index)
   POST   /order-items          Create  (new)
   GET    /order-items/{id}     Get     (show)
   PATCH  /order-items/{id}     Update  (edit)
   DELETE /order-items/{id}     Delete  (delete)

 Next: go test ./... and dygo routes; try them at /docs.
