The main package (.) does not run console commands yet. Add this to main before the server starts:

	if len(os.Args) > 1 { // go run . <command>
		os.Exit(console.Main(ctx, AppModule(cfg, log), os.Args[1:], dygo.WithLogger(log)))
	}

with the import "github.com/dygoframework/dygo/console".

Next: dygo run seed-data, and dygo run lists every command.
